{"3667730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Console Store Simulator", "steam_appid": 3667730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, grow, and turn your second-hand game store into the most popular shop in town! <br><br>In this immersive first-person shop simulation, you start with a small store and take full control of every aspect of the game and console trade. Stock your shelves, negotiate with customers, manage your inventory, and grow your business through smart buying and selling. <br><br>Buy low, sell smart, and maximize your profits. Every item, every customer, and every deal brings you one step closer to building a bigger and more successful store. <br><br><strong>Build your store from scratch</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/47977aabd578509330552b3cd353e7f7.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/47977aabd578509330552b3cd353e7f7.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/47977aabd578509330552b3cd353e7f7.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn an empty shop into a thriving game store. Purchase games, consoles, and equipment, place them on shelves, and design your store the way you want. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get help from BearAI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/c2e3e7b2c0a3c2be684d46ef21f62961.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/c2e3e7b2c0a3c2be684d46ef21f62961.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/c2e3e7b2c0a3c2be684d46ef21f62961.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stuck on what to do next? Ask BearAI for help anytime. Whether you need guidance, tips, or answers about your shop, BearAI is there to support you when you need it most. Keep your business moving forward with your own in-game AI assistant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact directly with customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/a57a6200dc8021bbc79491fdd4d93f02.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/a57a6200dc8021bbc79491fdd4d93f02.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/a57a6200dc8021bbc79491fdd4d93f02.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every customer is a new opportunity. Sell your products, evaluate items they bring in, and negotiate to get the best deals. Smart decisions mean more profit—bad deals mean missed opportunities. <br><br><strong>Manage your inventory, grow your profits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/8538fc9f795b66590509f357d4fa2727.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/8538fc9f795b66590509f357d4fa2727.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/8538fc9f795b66590509f357d4fa2727.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Track which products sell the fastest, optimize your store layout, and improve efficiency. A successful shop isn’t just about full shelves—it’s about smart management. <br><br><strong>Open your own game café</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/3c005568dfdd04abe8800acab79eda92.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/3c005568dfdd04abe8800acab79eda92.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/3c005568dfdd04abe8800acab79eda92.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand beyond retail. Upgrade your store and open a game café area to offer more to your customers and turn your shop into the go-to hangout spot in town. <br><br><strong>Repair, restore, and resell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/22d3e31db8d428b0bc85454268aaec31.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/22d3e31db8d428b0bc85454268aaec31.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/22d3e31db8d428b0bc85454268aaec31.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Not every item is ready to sell. Fix damaged or worn-out equipment and turn it back into valuable inventory. Get the most out of every product. <br><br><strong>Step into the black market</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/22d3e31db8d428b0bc85454268aaec31.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/22d3e31db8d428b0bc85454268aaec31.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/22d3e31db8d428b0bc85454268aaec31.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Higher risk, higher reward. Explore off-the-record deals, hunt for rare items, and decide how far you're willing to go in the darker side of the trade. <br><br><strong>Customize your store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/3b7527a3c6ac59757be520f29c8a0195.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/3b7527a3c6ac59757be520f29c8a0195.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/3b7527a3c6ac59757be520f29c8a0195.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Upgrade your decorations, improve the atmosphere, and create a more attractive shop. A better-looking store means more customers—and more profit. <br><br><strong>Life goes on after work</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/4a11e45b818d377f5d5452f22cbf755a.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/4a11e45b818d377f5d5452f22cbf755a.webm?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/4a11e45b818d377f5d5452f22cbf755a.mp4?t=1778158420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After a long day, head to the bar, relax, and experience the world beyond your counter. This isn’t just a shop simulator—it’s your story. <br><br>Are you ready to build the most successful second-hand game store in town? <br><br><strong>Note:</strong> Buy low, sell high. This is not financial advice.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, grow, and turn your second-hand game store into the most popular shop in town! <br><br>In this immersive first-person shop simulation, you start with a small store and take full control of every aspect of the game and console trade. Stock your shelves, negotiate with customers, manage your inventory, and grow your business through smart buying and selling. <br><br>Buy low, sell smart, and maximize your profits. Every item, every customer, and every deal brings you one step closer to building a bigger and more successful store. <br><br><strong>Build your store from scratch</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/extras/47977aabd578509330552b3cd353e7f7.poster.avif?t=1778158420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/